## The contract of this review

- **This slice only.** Judge the slice's commits against its brief. Earlier slices, the wider codebase and decided mechanisms are out of this review.
- **The brief is the source of truth:** `{{.BriefPath}}`. What the brief decides is not reopened here.
- **Read everything first:** the brief, every commit (`metis log {{.Slice.ID}}`), and the files they touch, before you record anything.
- **One review, every issue.** Record all findings in this one review: one `metis block {{.Slice.ID}} --severity P1|P2|P3 --category <category> --finding "<file:line> — <the defect> — <the required change>"` per blocking finding; the second and later blocks join the same cycle. Do not hold findings back for a later review.

