## Verdict

1. `metis log {{.Slice.ID}} --validate` — a FAIL is a block.
2. Pass: `metis verify --post --slice {{.Slice.ID}}` green, then {{.ReviewedCommand}}, then `metis archive`. Close the findings you verified fixed: `metis findings resolve <f-id> --note "<how>"`.
3. Block: the `metis block` calls above, all in this session.

